  "description": "freshness.v1 §2.1, §2.2, §2.3: a resolved resource's authoring kind (stream, state, event, operation; @stream and @state are read as stream and state) and its merged annotations -> its horizon. expect.horizon is one of: \"none\" (no freshness.ttl_s: not asked); \"ignored\" (an event or an operation, whatever the value: no freshness); \"invalid\" (a value that is not a whole number of seconds from 0 to 2^53-1; an integral float is that integer); \"never\" (0); \"within\", with ttl_s, the horizon in seconds, and refresh_ms, the owner's bound between two puts of a member, ttl_s/2 in milliseconds (§2.4). The kind is read before the value."
}
